---
// Prerendered to STATIC HTML on purpose (2026-09-10). This page has no
// per-request data — everything on it is hardcoded. Static output is served
// straight from Cloudflare's edge via the ASSETS binding WITHOUT invoking the
// worker, which is what removes the 20s cold start (see CLAUDE.md).
// If this page is ever wired to the CMS, delete this line so it returns to SSR.
export const prerender = true;
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
	title={'About | Liberty Hearing Center'}
	description={'Meet the audiologists and team behind Liberty Hearing Center in College Station, TX.'}
	active="about"
	footer="inner"
>
<section style="background:var(--surface-blue)">
<div style="max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:56px clamp(18px,4vw,32px) 0">
<nav style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:9px 20px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--white);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(var(--navy-rgb),.06)">
<a href="/" style="transition:.3s" style-hover="color:var(--gold)">Home</a><span style="color:var(--text-muted)">/</span>
<span style="color:var(--text-muted)">About</span>
</nav>
<div data-stack="2" style="margin-top:34px;padding-bottom:72px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 520px;gap:60px;align-items:center">
<div>
<span style="display:block;margin-bottom:18px;color:var(--brand-red);font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase">About Liberty Hearing Center</span>
<h1 style="margin:0 0 22px;color:var(--navy);font-size:clamp(38px,4.2vw,64px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.045em;text-wrap:balance">Good hearing care is personal.</h1>
<p style="margin:0;max-width:640px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.7;text-wrap:pretty">Liberty Hearing Center is an audiology and hearing aid clinic with expert audiologists providing hearing tests and professional hearing services in College Station, TX.</p>
<div style="margin-top:28px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap">
<a href="/book-appointment/" style="display:inline-flex;min-height:50px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:12px 24px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:999px;background:var(--brand-red);color:var(--white);font-size:14px;font-weight:750;transition:.3s" style-hover="background:var(--navy);transform:translateY(-2px)">Schedule Your Appointment</a>
<a href="#team" style="display:inline-flex;min-height:50px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:12px 24px;border:1px solid var(--brand-red);border-radius:999px;background:var(--white);color:var(--brand-red);font-size:14px;font-weight:750;transition:.3s" style-hover="border-color:var(--navy);background:var(--navy);color:var(--white);transform:translateY(-2px)">Meet the Team</a>
</div>
</div>
<figure style="margin:0;overflow:hidden;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 18px 45px rgba(var(--navy-rgb),.11)"><img src="/assets/team.webp" alt="The Liberty Hearing Center team" style="display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section style="background:var(--white)">
<div data-stack="2" style="max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(46px,8vw,80px) clamp(18px,4vw,32px) 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:340px minmax(0,1fr);gap:64px;align-items:start">
<h2 data-sticky="1" style="margin:0;position:sticky;top:150px;color:var(--navy);font-size:clamp(28px,2.5vw,40px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.04em;text-wrap:balance">Good hearing is easy to take for granted.</h2>
<div style="max-width:740px">
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.75;text-wrap:pretty">Then suddenly the dinner table gets harder to follow, phone calls take more effort than they should, and conversations in noisy places start to feel exhausting rather than enjoyable.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">Most people wait years before doing anything about it — not because they don't care, but because they're not sure where to start or what to expect when they get there.</p>
<p style="margin:0;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">Liberty Hearing Center exists to make that first step easier. We are a locally owned audiology practice in College Station, TX, built around the belief that hearing care should be personal, unhurried, and honest.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="team" style="background:var(--white);scroll-margin-top:150px">
<div style="max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(46px,8vw,80px) clamp(18px,4vw,32px)">
<div style="margin-bottom:40px;padding-bottom:22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px;flex-wrap:wrap">
<h2 style="margin:0;color:var(--navy);font-size:clamp(28px,2.5vw,40px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.04em">Meet the team</h2>
<span style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:14px">College Station, TX</span>
</div>
<div data-stack="3" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:30px">
<article style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;background:var(--white);overflow:hidden;transition:.3s" style-hover="box-shadow:0 22px 55px rgba(var(--navy-rgb),.13);transform:translateY(-4px)">
<img src="/assets/dr-chris.webp" alt="Dr. Chris Duhon, AuD" style="display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:3/2;object-fit:cover;object-position:center top" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
<div style="padding:28px 30px 32px">
<h3 style="margin:0 0 4px;color:var(--navy);font-size:22px;font-weight:750;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.025em">Dr. Chris Duhon, AuD</h3>
<span style="display:block;margin-bottom:16px;color:var(--gold);font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase">Doctor of Audiology</span>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;text-wrap:pretty">Dr. Duhon is a Texas-licensed audiologist holding the Certificate of Clinical Competence in Audiology (CCC-A) from the American Speech-Language-Hearing Association (ASHA) and is affiliated with the Texas Academy of Audiology.</p>
<a href="/dr-chris-duhon/" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;color:var(--brand-red);font-size:14px;font-weight:750;transition:.3s" style-hover="color:var(--navy)">Learn more <span>→</span></a>
</div>
</article>
<article style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;background:var(--white);overflow:hidden;transition:.3s" style-hover="box-shadow:0 22px 55px rgba(var(--navy-rgb),.13);transform:translateY(-4px)">
<img src="/assets/dr-carly.webp" alt="Dr. Carly Hall, AuD" style="display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:3/2;object-fit:cover;object-position:center top" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
<div style="padding:28px 30px 32px">
<h3 style="margin:0 0 4px;color:var(--navy);font-size:22px;font-weight:750;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.025em">Dr. Carly Hall, AuD</h3>
<span style="display:block;margin-bottom:16px;color:var(--gold);font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase">Doctor of Audiology</span>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;text-wrap:pretty">Dr. Hall is a Texas-licensed audiologist with the CCC-A from ASHA, bringing her own warmth and clinical depth to every patient interaction.</p>
<a href="/dr-carly-hall/" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;color:var(--brand-red);font-size:14px;font-weight:750;transition:.3s" style-hover="color:var(--navy)">Learn more <span>→</span></a>
</div>
</article>
<article style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;background:var(--white);overflow:hidden;transition:.3s" style-hover="box-shadow:0 22px 55px rgba(var(--navy-rgb),.13);transform:translateY(-4px)">
<img src="/assets/rocio.webp" alt="Mrs. Rocio Zarandona" style="display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:3/2;object-fit:cover;object-position:center top" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
<div style="padding:28px 30px 32px">
<h3 style="margin:0 0 4px;color:var(--navy);font-size:22px;font-weight:750;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.025em">Mrs. Rocio Zarandona</h3>
<span style="display:block;margin-bottom:16px;color:var(--gold);font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase">Patient Care</span>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;text-wrap:pretty">Rocio is the warmth you feel the moment you walk through our door. Originally from Spain, she brings an energy and genuine care for people that transcends language, background, and circumstance.</p>
<a href="/rocio-zarandona/" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;color:var(--brand-red);font-size:14px;font-weight:750;transition:.3s" style-hover="color:var(--navy)">Learn more <span>→</span></a>
</div>
</article>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section style="background:var(--cream)">
<div data-stack="2" style="max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(49px,8vw,84px) clamp(18px,4vw,32px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:.95fr 1.05fr;gap:clamp(32px,5vw,64px);align-items:center">
<figure style="margin:0;overflow:hidden;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 18px 45px rgba(var(--navy-rgb),.11)"><img src="/assets/reviewing-results.webp" alt="Dr. Chris Duhon walking a patient and her family through her hearing test results" style="display:block;width:100%;height:clamp(260px,46vw,430px);object-fit:cover;object-position:center 40%" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;max-width:620px">
<h2 style="margin:0;color:var(--navy);font-size:clamp(28px,2.5vw,40px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.04em;text-wrap:balance">Care Begins With Understanding You</h2>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;text-wrap:pretty">Before we recommend anything, we want to understand your world. Where do you struggle to hear most — at the dinner table, in a crowded restaurant, on the phone, at church, or during your grandkids' soccer games? Who do you most want to hear clearly, and what conversations matter most to you?</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;text-wrap:pretty">Your hearing challenges are as unique as your life. That's why we take the time to learn your specific situations before recommending solutions — so you can stay in the conversation, stay connected to the people you love, and never feel left in the dark or on the outside looking in.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section style="background:var(--navy);color:var(--border-strong)">
<div data-stack="2" style="max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(49px,8vw,84px) clamp(18px,4vw,32px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:64px;align-items:start">
<div>
<span style="display:block;margin-bottom:16px;color:var(--gold-light);font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase">Community pricing</span>
<h2 style="margin:0 0 20px;color:var(--white);font-size:clamp(28px,2.5vw,40px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.04em;text-wrap:balance">Proudly serving those who serve our community</h2>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px;max-width:520px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">As a locally owned practice, Liberty Hearing Center is honored to extend special discount pricing on hearing technology to the people who keep this community running.</p>
<p style="margin:0;max-width:520px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">The least we can do is make sure hearing care is within reach for them.</p>
</div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(var(--white-rgb),.16)"><span style="color:var(--gold-light);font-weight:800">—</span><span style="color:var(--white);font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.5">Active-duty military and veterans</span></div>
<div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(var(--white-rgb),.16)"><span style="color:var(--gold-light);font-weight:800">—</span><span style="color:var(--white);font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.5">Law enforcement officers</span></div>
<div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(var(--white-rgb),.16)"><span style="color:var(--gold-light);font-weight:800">—</span><span style="color:var(--white);font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.5">Firefighters</span></div>
<div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(var(--white-rgb),.16)"><span style="color:var(--gold-light);font-weight:800">—</span><span style="color:var(--white);font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.5">Nurses and EMTs</span></div>
<div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(var(--white-rgb),.16);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(var(--white-rgb),.16)"><span style="color:var(--gold-light);font-weight:800">—</span><span style="color:var(--white);font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.5">All Brazos Valley ISD employees<span style="display:block;margin-top:6px;color:var(--border-strong);font-size:15px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.65">Including teachers, classroom support staff, paraprofessionals, bus drivers, cafeteria staff, custodial staff, and campus-based employees.</span></span></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section style="background:var(--white)">
<div style="max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(49px,8vw,84px) clamp(18px,4vw,32px)">
<h2 style="margin:0 0 34px;color:var(--navy);font-size:clamp(28px,2.5vw,40px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.04em">Our credentials</h2>
<div data-stack="2" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:26px">
<div style="padding:34px 36px;border-radius:16px;background:var(--surface)">
<strong style="display:block;margin-bottom:16px;color:var(--navy);font-size:20px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:-.02em">Dr. Chris Duhon, AuD</strong>
<ul style="margin:0;padding-left:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7">
<li>Texas Licensed Audiologist</li>
<li>Certificate of Clinical Competence in Audiology (CCC-A), American Speech-Language-Hearing Association</li>
<li>Member, Texas Academy of Audiology</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div style="padding:34px 36px;border-radius:16px;background:var(--surface)">
<strong style="display:block;margin-bottom:16px;color:var(--navy);font-size:20px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:-.02em">Dr. Carly Hall, AuD</strong>
<ul style="margin:0;padding-left:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7">
<li>Texas Licensed Audiologist</li>
<li>Certificate of Clinical Competence in Audiology (CCC-A), American Speech-Language-Hearing Association</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="book" style="background:var(--surface-blue);scroll-margin-top:150px">
<div style="max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(49px,8vw,84px) clamp(18px,4vw,32px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center">
<span style="display:block;margin-bottom:16px;color:var(--brand-red);font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase">Start here</span>
<h2 style="margin:0 0 20px;max-width:820px;color:var(--navy);font-size:clamp(30px,3vw,46px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-.04em;text-wrap:balance">Your hearing journey starts with a conversation.</h2>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;max-width:680px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.75;text-wrap:pretty">At Liberty Hearing Center, we take the time to get to know you — where you're from, how you spend your days, and what better hearing would make possible for you. That conversation is where everything good begins.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 30px;max-width:680px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.75;text-wrap:pretty">Schedule your appointment today and find out what hearing well can feel like.</p>
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center">
<a href="/book-appointment/" style="display:inline-flex;min-height:52px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:12px 28px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:999px;background:var(--brand-red);color:var(--white);font-size:15px;font-weight:750;transition:.3s" style-hover="background:var(--navy);transform:translateY(-2px)">Schedule Your Appointment</a>
<a href="tel:9794507996" style="display:inline-flex;min-height:52px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:12px 28px;border:1px solid var(--brand-red);border-radius:999px;background:var(--white);color:var(--brand-red);font-size:15px;font-weight:750;transition:.3s" style-hover="border-color:var(--navy);background:var(--navy);color:var(--white);transform:translateY(-2px)">Call 979-450-7996</a>
</div>
<p style="margin:16px 0 0;color:var(--text-muted);font-size:14px">Same-week appointments are available.</p>
</div>
</section>
</Base>
